5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to verify the actual monthly cost of this floor before we commit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about the sound and comfort at my specific desk spot.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know how much time the changeover will eat into my gaps.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We need to decide who gets the worse seats before we start moving.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Who sits next to whom changes how we talk. I want to see the plan.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, if the cost is high, maybe we keep the current layout?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, what specifically are you looking for?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, I just need to know the time commitment for any plan.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, I want to know if the current spots are actually usable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I think the survey data might help us see the preferences.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’m worried about the morning rush.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll look into the billing basis.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the drawn plan against the survey.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll look at the sound readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the arrival times and what the new joiners said.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let’s see what we find.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,Yes.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
